  "cre_rule": "the shortwave and longwave fields are outgoing fluxes and the net field is downward minus upward, so the cloud radiative effect is the clear-sky minus the all-sky flux in the shortwave and the longwave and the all-sky minus the clear-sky flux in the net, which is the product's own arithmetic (the data quality summary: cloud radiative effects are computed as all-sky flux minus clear-sky flux, the net being downward minus upward)",
